(label "DW_VCC" (at 101.6 236.22 270) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "c22fe235-b7a2-5c25-a2c3-c35ddb6d331a"))
(text "Rollo board: ESP32-H2 chip, TP4054 charger (about 420 mA with R14 = 2.4k), DW01A + HJ8205 protection, AD116 motor driver, XC6206 LDO. JLCPCB parts, LCSC numbers in the LCSC field. Not built or tested." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 246.38 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0aa994d6-f395-55cb-a7b2-31b64f832f83"))
(text "Protection: VBAT is B+. GND is P-: the cell's minus (BATN) only reaches it through Q1. Never tie BATN to GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "537d9620-491b-566b-991f-d75e55f6f9dd"))
(text "Firmware pins: GPIO10/11 to the AD116 AIN/BIN (100k pull-downs keep the motor off at boot), GPIO1 battery (1M/1M). GPIO8/9 strapping: pulled up, BOOT pulls GPIO9 low." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f32a2c3f-b5b7-50dc-bb90-1e5a0cc2b7b5"))
(text "RF: C21/L21/C22 is the chip-side CLC match (start values from the Espressif guidelines, tune), then a short trace to AE1. No antenna-side match: add one if tuning needs it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "44e28f53-8ade-5998-bf5c-1eb18d368d56"))
(text "Crystal: 32 MHz, 6 pF load, 10 ppm. L1 24 nH in series with XTAL_P. C1/C2 6.8 pF. Antenna: R22 from the antenna's second terminal to GND tunes it (start 0 ohm)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 152.4 256.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "26766e2b-dd22-5c32-951f-4fa3f839c6d5"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))) (embedded_fonts no))
